hin 19 hours of the dose:\n\n- she spoke for 5 hours straight\n- was able to recognize her family\n- hold complex conversations\n- dress herself\n- regain bladder control\n- walk unassisted\n\n5 grams of mushrooms... gave her quality of life again.\n\nThis makes you wonder:\n\nHow much of an aging brain is actually gone and how much is waiting... to be switched back on.\n\nOne month later, she took a follow-up dose of 3 grams and improved even more...\n\nhttps://www.frontiersin.org/journals/neuroscience/articles/10.3389/fnins.2026.1813281/full", "author": "TheLawofOne-", "created": 1786047688610, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Cakes4077", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "They don\u2019t want actual treatments ", "last_comment_created": 1786053179528, "content": "<p>An 80-year-old woman with severe Alzheimer's took one dose of Enigma Strain psilocybin.</p>\n<p>This is a woman who hadn't spoken for 10 years. Within 19 hours of the dose:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>she spoke for 5 hours straight</li>\n<li>was able to recognize her family</li>\n<li>hold complex conversations</li>\n<li>dress herself</li>\n<li>regain bladder control</li>\n<li>walk unassisted</li>\n</ul>\n<p>5 grams of mushrooms... gave her quality of life again.</p>\n<p>This makes you wonder:</p>\n<p>How much of an aging brain is actually gone and how much is waiting... to be switched back on.</p>\n<p>One month later, she took a follow-up dose of 3 grams and improved even more...</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/neuroscience/articles/10.3389/fnins.2026.1813281/full\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/neuroscience/articles/10.3389/fnins.2026.1813281/full</a></p>\n